  "description": "The components studio 1.0 adds to https://adk-rust.com/a2ui/catalogs/forms/1.0/catalog.json, which a surface mixes with it",
  "instructions": "App: {\"component\": \"App\", \"title\", \"pages\": [{\"id\", \"title\", \"child\": \"<a Page's id>\"}] (1 to 24), \"navigation\": \"top|side\", \"initialPage\"}; the home shows it as tabs.\nBadge: {\"component\": \"Badge\", \"text\", \"tone\": \"neutral|info|success|warning|danger\"}; a status word such as \"Shipped\", never a decision's word.\nChart: {\"component\": \"Chart\", \"kind\": \"bar|line|area|pie|scatter\", \"title\", \"data\": {\"@path\": \"/rows\"} (at most 500 row objects), \"x\": {\"key\", \"type\": \"category|number|time\", \"label\"}, \"series\": [{\"key\", \"label\"}] (1 to 8; a pie uses the first), \"yLabel\", \"valueFormat\": \"number|percent|currency\", \"currency\", \"timeUnit\", \"window\"}.\nKeyValue: {\"component\": \"KeyValue\", \"title\", \"items\": [{\"key\", \"value\"}] (at most 50), or \"data\": {\"@path\": \"/rows\"} with \"keyField\" and \"valueField\"}.\nMetric: {\"component\": \"Metric\", \"label\", \"value\", \"unit\", \"format\": \"number|percent|currency\", \"currency\", \"delta\": {\"value\", \"goodWhen\": \"up|down\"}, \"caption\", \"status\": \"ok|warning|critical|info|neutral\", \"trend\": {\"@path\": \"/numbers\"}}.\nPage: {\"component\": \"Page\", \"title\", \"description\", \"layout\": \"stack|grid|split\", \"children\": [ids]}.\nProgress: {\"component\": \"Progress\", \"label\", \"value\": 0 to 100, \"tone\", \"indeterminate\"}. Move it with patch_surface as the work moves.\nRegion: {\"component\": \"Region\", \"title\", \"layout\": \"stack|grid|split\", \"columns\": 1 to 4, \"tone\", \"variant\": \"plain|hero\", \"children\": [ids]}.\nScene3D: {\"component\": \"Scene3D\", \"title\", \"description\", \"objects\": [{\"id\", \"shape\": \"box|sphere|cylinder|cone|plane|torus\", \"position\": [x, y, z], \"rotation\", \"scale\", \"color\": \"#rrggbb\", \"label\"}] (1 to 64), \"camera\", \"height\", \"autoRotate\", \"controls\": \"none|orbit\"}; primitives only, no models; the home draws it in 3D in its own colours.\nSparkline: {\"component\": \"Sparkline\", \"data\": {\"@path\": \"/values\"} (numbers, or rows with \"key\"), \"label\", \"tone\", \"window\"}.\nVegaLite: {\"component\": \"VegaLite\", \"title\", \"spec\": a Vega-Lite spec with one mark (bar, line, area, point or arc) and encoding x, y, color (a series per value) or theta (a pie), \"data\": {\"@path\": \"/rows\"} or the spec's data.values (at most 500 rows); no transforms, layers, facets or URLs.\n- Put the numbers in dataModel and bind them, as {\"@path\": \"/sales\"}; never paste data into labels.\n- A chart draws at most 500 rows and 8 series: aggregate or downsample first, and say so in its title.\n- Label things with plain words. A drawing never shows a decision's words (Allow once, Always allow, Waiting for you, You said yes, You said no, Confirm it's you, Stop all, Resume all, Take over, Add this agent, Edit, Deny, Done, Approve, Approved, Decided, Don't add), links, images or password fields, and is refused if it does: say it in your reply or draw it another way.\n- Every component needs a unique id, and one has the id root.",
  "protocolVersion": "1.0",
  "title": "studio 1.0"
}
